Full protection, multifunctional: The dual swivel lock and sealable closure clip design access, offers for your device and other personal items, full protection (waterproof / snow proof / dirt proof protection) against water, snow, sand, dirt, even storm & extreme bad condition. The phone pouch can protect not only your phone, but also the carry-on documents, credit cards, or your cash etc. Very perfect for underwater use, swimmers, surfers and scuba divers, indoor &outdoor activities, travel
